{"branch":"다산점(W+)","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">다산점(W+)의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-72a09f5f5eab927a.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"다산점(W+) 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-72a09f5f5eab927a.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>경기 남양주시 다산순환로 350 KB골든타워 310호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 8호선</span><span>다산역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>힐스테이트후문</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>힐스테이트후문</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>다산롯데캐슬정문</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>다산롯데캐슬정문</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>다산아이파크.롯데캐슬</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>다산롯데캐슬.아이파크</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">7</span><span>e편한세상.힐스테이트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">8</span><span>힐스테이트.e편한세상</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">9</span><span>다산선형공원</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">10</span><span>다산역데시앙</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">11</span><span>다산선형공원</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">일반</span></dt><dd><span>땡큐10</span><span>땡큐12</span><span>34</span><span>95</span><span>76</span><span>79</span><span>땡큐90</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">직행</span></dt><dd><